+	depends on BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
+	help
+	  Say Y here if you want to enable support for the Fitipower
+	  FL7707N based 720x720 2-lane MIPI-DSI panel (e.g. the
+	  QV040YNQ-N80 4.0 IPS module).
+ 
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile
